===== attempt 2 / 2 =====
The verify failure is fixed and the RESULT is updated.

**Root cause of the retry failure**: this worktree had no `node_modules` installed at all — worktrees don't inherit the git-ignored `node_modules` from the main checkout, so nearly every `tsc` error was a module-resolution failure, not a real problem with the cam-mute copy diff.

**Fix**: ran `npm ci` in `mobile/` (uses the tracked lockfile, no dependency changes). After that, `tsc --noEmit` dropped from hundreds of errors to one: a pre-existing `Cannot find module './adaptiveQuality'` in `MediaSession.ts` that I confirmed (via `git stash`) exists on `HEAD`/`main` independent of this change, and is out of scope to fix (touching `MediaSession.ts` is forbidden by the task).

The cam-mute copy itself (`live.tsx` hint + `accessibilityHint`, and `mobile.live.camOffHint` in all 14 i18n overlays) was already correctly implemented from the prior attempt — I verified it via diff review and JSON parsing. RESULT is written with `COMPLETE`, branch `admin/20260807T175211Z-021b-cam-mute-parity-reapply` confirmed present, and connect risk marked low/copy-only.
